    FloconWebSocketEvent(websocketUrl: url.absoluteString, event: .sendMessage, message: text)
)
</code></pre> <p>The events are <code>.open</code>, <code>.sendMessage</code>, <code>.receiveMessage</code>, <code>.closing</code>, <code>.closed</code> and <code>.error</code>.</p> <p>WebSocket traffic is not intercepted automatically. Call <code>Flocon.network.logWebSocketEvent</code> for each event you want to see:</p> <pre><code>import 'package:flocon/flocon.dart';

